# Allow only application/build inputs. Add new build inputs deliberately.
**
!Dockerfile
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!requirements*.txt
!requirements*.lock
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# Exclude private data even if it appears beneath an allowed directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/private
**/receipts
**/media
**/data
**/logs
**/.venv
**/.cache
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.sql
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
